Brand sound logo asset list
title end

paragraph start
A sound logo is a very short sound that identifies the brand. This page lists its files and the licence of every sound used to make it.
paragraph end

paragraph start
Every sound in it must be owned or licensed for commercial use. Keep the licence note beside the file.
paragraph end

